# Recorded input for the checkbox page (widgets/checkbox.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 120 in the
# default theme: "All" (tri-state, starts mixed) at y 12..30, "Wireframe" at y 38..55 and
# "Shadows" (on) at y 63..81, each box at x 12..28. One line per frame below (format:
# input.Replay). Scancodes: Space 44, Enter 40.
# 0: rest: All mixed, Wireframe off, Shadows on
frame
viewport 320 120
dt 0.016
pointer 300 110
# 1: press All
frame
pointer 20 21
buttons left
# 2: release: mixed -> on
frame
buttons
# 3: Space up on the focused All: on -> off
frame
release 44
# 4: press Wireframe
frame
pointer 40 47
buttons left
# 5: release: on
frame
buttons
# 6: Enter does nothing to a checkbox
frame
press 40
# 7: Space down: nothing yet
frame
press 44
# 8: Space up: Wireframe off
frame
release 44
# 9: press Shadows, drag off, release: no toggle
frame
pointer 40 73
buttons left
# 10: dragged off
frame
pointer 300 110
# 11: released off it
frame
buttons
